---
description: TextTools module boundaries and a restart after app edits
globs: "**/*.{kt,kts,sq,md}"
alwaysApply: false
---

Edit only the module you were given. The domain module must not depend on Compose, Ktor or SQLDelight. A slice is unfinished without docs/dev. Read old AHK with git show archive/ahk:path. After each app change, stop the running TextTools process and start `./gradlew :app:run` again. A second launch only focuses the first process and exits, so the new windows stay hidden until that process is gone.
